# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CompProGraph -- lossless structural codec for PROV-JSON provenance corpora.
#
# The evaluation corpora and the benchmark output are large (~4.6 GB together)
# and are released separately as data artifacts, not through git. They are
# expected to sit alongside the codec in this directory when benchmarking.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Evaluation corpora -- local only, never committed
corpus-prov/
prov_corpus_light/
prov_corpus_scaled/
prov_corpus_large/
prov_corpus_full/

# Benchmark results, compressed artifacts, and round-trip scratch
results/
out_*/
reconstructed_*/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Editors / tooling
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# macOS junk (AppleDouble sidecars + Finder metadata). Never commit these.
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
__MACOSX/
Icon?
